#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:40 93a5ba9b3d0242e590fbb439885fe5ad
msgid ""
"Expected Outcome: Copter with low-cost 3D camera estimates its local "
"position by comparing the camera point cloud to a pre-generated 3D map"
msgstr "预期成果：配备低成本 3D 摄像头的 Copter，通过将摄像头点云与预生成的 3D 地图进行比较来估计其本地位置"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:42 dd209f6992494a669bbf35584812390b
msgid ""
"The goal of this project is to allow a Copter to estimate its local position"
" using a low-cost 3D camera (e.g. `Intel D455 "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-camera-d455>`__) by comparing the "
"camera's point cloud to a pre-generated 3D map.  The steps involved include:"
msgstr ""
"本项目的目标是使 Copter 能够通过低成本 3D 摄像头（例如 `Intel D455 "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-camera-d455>`__）将摄像头点云与预生成的 3D "
"地图进行比较来估计本地位置。相关步骤包括："

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:44 7d2fe65bf6a24fe1ad81b53e6138b591
msgid ""
"Create a tool to capture a 3D map of the flight area.  The resulting map "
"should be loaded onto the vehicle's companion computer (e.g. RPI5)"
msgstr "创建一个工具以采集飞行区域的 3D 地图，生成的地图应加载到飞行器的伴飞计算机（例如 RPI5）上"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:45 3dd185dfc8ce470a89856421d1006d75
msgid ""
"Mount a low-cost 3D camera (e.g. `Intel D455 "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-camera-d455>`__) onto an ArduPilot "
"copter (e.g. EDU650 or similar) equipped with a companion computer"
msgstr ""
"将低成本 3D 摄像头（例如 `Intel D455 <https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-"
"camera-d455>`__）安装到配备伴飞计算机的 ArduPilot 多旋翼飞行器（例如 EDU650 或类似型号）上"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:46 e87380eb33ad416ea900ea46a18ed127
msgid ""
"Write localisation software (e.g. python code) to compare the output of the "
"3D camera to the pre-generated 3D map and send the estimated position to the"
" vehicle's EKF (see :ref:`Non-GPS Position Estimation <mavlink-nongps-"
"position-estimation>`)"
msgstr ""
"编写定位软件（例如 Python 代码），将 3D 摄像头的输出与预生成的 3D 地图进行比较，并将估计的位置发送到飞行器的 EKF（参见 "
":ref:`非 GPS 位置估计 <mavlink-nongps-position-estimation>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:47 e5f115878fd845218af51519372c0efd
msgid "Implement a simulator of the system (e.g. gazebo)"
msgstr "实现系统的仿真器（例如 gazebo）"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:48 893d83c9cce2427faff0f6ac0ecee46e
msgid "Document the setup and operation for future developers and users"
msgstr "为未来的开发者和用户编写安装和操作文档"

