"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-camera-d455>`__) if necessary"
msgstr ""
"如有需要，将提供硬件资金，包括多旋翼飞行器（例如 Hexsoon EDU650）、伴飞计算机和 3D 摄像头（例如 `Intel D455 "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-camera-d455>`__）"

