#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:111 6024f16793b84a7f8adadd9d830572c5
msgid ""
"Expected Outcome: Lua script that uses re-inforcement learning to automate "
"changing some parameters"
msgstr "预期成果：使用强化学习自动化调整某些参数的 Lua 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:113 b703d2e1bc094edbb0d81008b242b17d
msgid ""
