#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:124 0deaad13071840c58a7728d5c54105ee
msgid ""
"A safe \"for education/rookies\" SITL test script that strips away the "
"majority of complexity in set-up and gives a Copter (and Plane if time "
"permits) that requires some basic tuning and gives hints/pointers in a UI "
"(this could lower the threshold for earlier year mech/electrical engineers "
"to get their hands dirty on some software and try out basic controls "
"testing)"
msgstr ""
"一个「面向教育/新手」的安全 SITL 测试脚本，大幅简化配置的复杂性，提供需要基本调参的 Copter（若时间允许还包括 Plane），并在 UI "
"中提供提示和指引（这可以降低低年级机械/电气工程专业学生入门软件并尝试基本控制测试的门槛）"

